  "content_blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Restricted procedure",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [
        "Restricted procedure"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In: Procure > Finalise and publish procurement pack",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "Restricted procedure"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Restricted procedure",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This regulation sets out the rules that apply to restricted procedure procurements. The regulation also sets out the rules regarding minimum time limits that a contracting authority may set for initial requests to participate and for those suppliers invited to submit a tender, the minimum time limits for receipt of those tenders which vary depending on the circumstances.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Restricted procedure",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "As per regulation 65 PCR 2015 (reduction of the number of otherwise qualified candidates to be invited to participate), the contracting authority must shortlist a minimum of five suppliers to participate in the procurement, provided that at least five suppliers meet the relevant selection criteria, including the minimum technical and professional ability standards.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Restricted procedure",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Restricted procedure",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The time limit for receipt of tenders must be specified in the procurement documents and must comply with the minimum periods set out in this regulation (i.e. regulation 28).",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Restricted procedure",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Restricted procedure",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities should:",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Restricted procedure",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "specify the time limit for receipt of requests to participate and, if a supplier is invited to participate, for the receipt of tenders (ensuring that all time periods comply with the minimum periods set out in this regulation; i.e. regulation 28)",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Restricted procedure",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "clearly set out in the procurement documents the number of suppliers that will be shortlisted following receipt of requests to participate (ensuring this is no fewer than the minimum permitted under regulation 65 PCR 2015; reduction of the number of otherwise qualified candidates to be invited to participate)",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Restricted procedure",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "clearly set out in the procurement documents how requests to participate will be evaluated and how the contracting authority will determine which suppliers are shortlisted to participate in the procurement for the purposes of submitting a tender.",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Restricted procedure",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Legal framework",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Restricted procedure",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "See also in the Procurement Act 2023:",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Restricted procedure",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Section 20: Competitive tendering procedures",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Restricted procedure",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Section 54: Time limits",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Restricted procedure",
